# Null Summoner's enters ability is independent of its source once it triggers (CR 113.7a): Bot2 bolts the Summoner in
# response, and the ability still makes Bot2 reveal its hand and exiles the Shock Bot1 chooses. But the permission to cast it is
# the Summoner's static ability (CR 604.1, 611.3a), which left the battlefield with it: once Brain Freeze has milled Bot1 to
# threshold, with Mox Pearl open, the Shock can't be cast from exile. The twin where it is cast is
# "...casts-the-exiled-card-only-once-it-has-threshold-with-mana-of-any-type".

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Null Summoner
Brain Freeze
Mox Pearl
Island x31

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Shock
Mountain x20

